ition effectively was a double-elimination tournament."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The Olympic wrestling tournament was held in the 15,300-seat " [:a {:href "/venues/302"} "Grand Olympic Auditorium"] ", where the competitions in " [:a {:href "/editions/10/sports/WLF"} "weightlifting"] " and " [:a {:href "/editions/10/sports/BOX"} "boxing"] " also took place. Match lengths were 20 minutes in Greco -Roman wrestling, and 15 minutes in freestyle. The audience had major problems following the competitions, as the state of the fights and their results were not clearly published. The strongest wrestling nations in Los Angeles were Sweden, with six titles, with the Americans winning three (all in freestyle) and the Finns two."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/122022"} "Bantamweight, Greco-Roman (≤56 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "4 –  7 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "7"] "\n" [:td {} "7"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/122039"} "Featherweight, Greco-Roman (≤61 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "4 –  7 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/122056"} "Lightweight, Greco-Roman (≤66 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "4 –  7 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n" [:td {} "6"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/122069"} "Welterweight, Greco-Roman (≤72 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "4 –  7 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/122087"} "Middleweight, Greco-Roman (≤79 kg), Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "4 –  7 August 1932"] "\n" [:td {} "4"] "\n" [:td {} "4"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {